message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CSAD: Cross-Satellite Authentication Diversity for Space-Based ADS-B"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Cross-Satellite Authentication Diversity (CSAD)
  architecture for TESLA-authenticated space-based ADS-B. The simulator propagates
  Walker-star LEO constellations with SGP4, computes per-aircraft and per-satellite
  link budgets and pure-ALOHA garbling, and evaluates four receiver architectures
  (IS-0, IS-R, NF, CSAD) in terms of authentication delay, deadline probability and
  Authenticated Surveillance Age (ASA).
